{
  "comment": "Curated NPC labor seed for EmploymentRegistry. block = workers that must never seed (heuristic false positives). assign = authoritative worker->employer edges: the nine start-of-game jarl courts (UESP-verified), famous shop/inn staff, and a reviewed vanilla draft. Rows tagged origin:'modlist' are NPCs from the author's dev load order, not base game + DLC — they resolve there and drop harmlessly (dropped-unresolved) everywhere else; the tag is informational only, the parser ignores it. 2026-08-01 pass: removed self-employ/mangled/reversed-ownership rows, deduped generic-name workers, fixed two employer names that could never resolve (Jarl Siddgeir -> Siddgeir, Jarl Skald -> Skald the Elder).",
  "_famousNote": [
    "Saadia/Mikael/Olfina Gray-Mane -> Hulda @ The Bannered Mare (Whiterun). Src: UESP Skyrim:The_Bannered_Mare infobox (Publican Hulda, Worker Saadia, Bard Mikael) + notes (Olfina class Food vendor, works the inn).",
    "Sigurd -> Belethor @ Belethor's General Goods (Whiterun). Src: SkyrimNet bio sigurd_D73 ('employee at Belethor's General Goods').",
    "Imedhnain -> Lisbet @ Arnleif and Sons Trading Company (Markarth). Src: SkyrimNet bio imedhnain_8EB ('assistant shopkeeper ... serving under the Nord owner Lisbet').",
    "Lisette -> Corpulus Vinius @ The Winking Skeever (Solitude). Src: UESP Skyrim:The_Winking_Skeever infobox (Proprietor Corpulus Vinius, Bard Lisette; 'the bard employed at the tavern').",
    "Orgnar/Sven -> Delphine @ Sleeping Giant Inn (Riverwood). Src: UESP Skyrim:Sleeping_Giant_Inn infobox (Publican Delphine, Innkeeper Orgnar, Bard Sven).",
    "Muiri -> Bothela @ The Hag's Cure (Markarth). Src: UESP Skyrim:The_Hag's_Cure infobox (Proprietor Bothela, Assistant Muiri).",
    "Talen-Jei -> Keerava @ The Bee and Barb (Riften). Src: UESP Skyrim:The_Bee_and_Barb infobox (Publican Keerava, Bartender Talen-Jei).",
    "Tacitus Sallustius -> Ghorza gra-Bagol @ Markarth smithy. Src: UESP Skyrim:Understone_Keep ('Ghorza gra-Bagol, who runs the public smithy for Markarth, and her assistant Tacitus Sallustius').",
    "Aicantar -> Calcelmo @ Understone Keep excavation. Src: UESP Skyrim:Understone_Keep ('Calcelmo's workstation, where he is aided by Aicantar')."
  ],
